{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132210","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1013221001:1":{"text":"梅瑞特，虽然没有太多时间相处，其实我一直想跟你成为朋友。","source_cn":"梅瑞特，虽然没有太多时间相处，其实我一直想跟你成为朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F04CDE447885D6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013221002:1":{"text":"啊？我还以为我们已经是朋友了。不过，希望下次见面的时候，你没有被关在笼子里。","source_cn":"啊？我还以为我们已经是朋友了。不过，希望下次见面的时候...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F9CC56A5424AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013221003:1":{"text":"我也不是故意的……下次，我一定精进宝石魔法，拿着莱希拉姆的录取通知书给你瞧瞧！","source_cn":"我也不是故意的……下次，我一定精进宝石魔法，拿着莱希拉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1090BC0777C0E7F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013221004:1":{"text":"一言为定！我就不久留了，各位，再见啦。","source_cn":"一言为定！我就不久留了，各位，再见啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A2DC19FF22A354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1013221004":{"text":"一言为定！我就不久留了，各位，再见啦。","source_cn":"一言为定！我就不久留了，各位，再见啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A2DC19FF22A354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_tit